  "description": "This makes a total of 4 servings of Asado Chicken with Spinach. Each serving comes out to be 312 calories, 24.3g fats, 3.4g net carbs, and 21.5g protein.",
  "servings": 4,
  "yield": [
    "4",
    "4 servings"
  ],
  "prepTime": "PT15M",
